{"id":"n15973-1-7","stage":1,"title":"결심 · 决心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15973-1-7-1","ko":"너 정말 그 일을 해야겠니?","zh":"你真的非得做那件事吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61175","senseId":"2","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠니","audio":"/audio/d16b214456613ae2d93a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61175","definition":"用于强调要做某件事情的意志。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a70cf36cbd3246158940.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15973-1-7-2","ko":"어머니, 뭐라고 하셔도 제 결심에는 변함이 없어요.","zh":"妈妈，无论您怎么说，我的决心都不会改变。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐라고","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐라고","audio":"/audio/95d23f1968b7f0de1b5c.mp3"}},{"text":"하셔도","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하셔도","audio":"/audio/ac53853df4aeb79c63fa.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"결심에는","meaning":"决心，下定决心","explanation":"결심：决心，下定决心；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"결심","audio":"/audio/b6adac94e2085d0918b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15973","senseId":"1","lemma":"결심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결심에는","audio":"/audio/531d40eb77136062c7a6.mp3"}},{"text":"변함이","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；ㅁ：将前面的动作或状态名词化，常用于书面表达。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변함이","audio":"/audio/365ee30f526c54850895.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"b6adac94e2085d09","term":"결심","zh":"决心，下定决心","audio":"/audio/b6adac94e2085d0918b0.mp3","entryId":"15973","definition":"心里坚定地决定怎么做；或指那种心情。","pronunciation":["결씸"]},{"id":"35e71a5db7e3493c","term":"변하다","zh":"变，改变，变成","audio":"/a